# Keep Vercel builds lean when the Git repo root is the workspace.
# Prefer setting Vercel "Root Directory" to apps/web (or admin/docs).
# Anchor to repo-root paths — unanchored names also matched apps/docs,
# packages/database, and apps/admin/.../infrastructure, which broke pnpm.
/services
/database
/infrastructure
.local-data
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
/docs
*.md
!apps/**/README.md
